++"""
++T-047 control plane: the ledger an erasure run is driven from.
++
++These two tables carry no personal data beyond the subject's id and the ids
++of rows the run must reach. A register of who asked to be erased is itself
++personal data, so nothing here stores a name, an email or free text — only
++references and counts. `PERSONAL_DATA_MATRIX.md` §3 gives the completion
++record its own 24-month clock for the same reason.
++"""
